{"about_the_game":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transverse The Forgotten Kingdoms</h2></strong><br><br>On the isolated island of Solis, the history of many past kingdoms thrive and fallen throughout the years frozen in time.<br><br>Amo is a 2D top-down metroidvania action adventure on an seemingly deserted island. But not everything is as it seems. Explore old kingdoms, open seas, and the heavens to find a way off the island and learn of your past.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Transverse the overworld, underworld, and the sky above to leave the island in one piece.<br></li><li>Solve the puzzles with flight, bombs, and your trusty whip throughout the journey.<br></li><li>Help stranded souls with side quests to finally rest in peace.<br></li><li>Over 700 unique rooms<br></li><li>Fight over a variety of 40 Bosses across the lands.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2777950?t=1758899191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2777950?t=1758899191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777950/5ffcf0c975c74bbb6bdb6886a859b37b8d986bf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758899191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777950/5ffcf0c975c74bbb6bdb6886a859b37b8d986bf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758899191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transverse The Forgotten Kingdoms</h2></strong><br><br>On the isolated island of Solis, the history of many past kingdoms thrive and fallen throughout the years frozen in time.<br